<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-20T01:58:18.088Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:58:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has intensified its maritime campaign, attacking container ships in the Strait of Hormuz, striking a tug there, and launching missiles near the UAE while its IRGC conducts drone and artillery strikes in Iraqi Kurdistan after installing a new defence minister. Tehran has urged the reopening of the strait and Lavrov visited Tehran, publicly backing Iran amid questions about Moscow’s role. Houthi forces have repeatedly struck Yemeni army and government training camps, killing dozens of recruits in Shabwa and elsewhere. Pakistan has suspended border trade with Iran following cross-border violence. 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/19/strait-of-hormuz-spilt-cargo-iran-attacks-container-ships&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/business/economy/gas-prices-inflation-cpi.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOSXFqMTJmVlRrSjR1NmNocW1VRWFpV1pSMjlNZDh1YXBsS2gyRkE0c19uRXJCQXN4Nklqajh6Tk4yeHhlRWRpWG81WXJMRVJmWXREaXZ2UkJfT3FNOFJndW9PNHBTZFRvVGJnbmFkeU10ZDlWdWY2N0kzVkFDVTh5NG0zZlZiM0N3bWthZmF2LUJjUXlEd29WOVRLZFdodFA0YlcwRl9fX0ptQ2dyN2I5RjVfRWJxRW1vYmF6VURGWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOMk5EVm9pS2FDMERjOC1yUnd6dVNiSUhheVpTYkQxclZpSU5ER01JdU1nSHVxb2pldzdpYXYwTDdmVmtZemc0UjJVY3RCVlkwR04yalhMZlZLU2c3ZDRRdnVqbmI3RUlmRENfX0o3aWJfZEZXbmp5QVVFWHpwYXhVYzFZekFWbG9EWmhZS09kS19XTkhyMENXTS05VVpyeS1fU0F2NXJ4X0hmYmg1OHQ5TjhCWTg4ckE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&